  "limitations": [
    "Numeric metadata-derived fields with generic SetValue and twenty-bone SetRawValue; actual typed native callback computations are not executed",
    "No meshes, draws, presentation, parameter blocks, arbitrary source mutations, device loss or effect lifetime qualification",
    "Static parameter values are constant within a workload; one bone component changes per group in all/pose-only/filtered modes; no-writes is an artificial non-equivalent ceiling control",
    "Filter reads current parameter bytes on every call; no persistent value cache; successful GetValue and exact comparison can skip SetValue for this fixture only",
    "Getter/setter error equivalence, parameter-block recording and actual typed setters still require qualification",
    "Poisoned-state controls compare 256 vertex and 32 pixel float registers and shader hashes for the selected unit techniques; no pixel comparison or general device-state equivalence claim",
    "Default mode still reports three D3DX27/D3DX43 command differences and exits 2; this does not authorize replacing the runtime",
    "Lit and shadow cases each use 850 groups; do not add their savings or infer gameplay FPS"
  ],
